                                                        "propertyValues": {
                                                            "html": {
                                                                "type": "TRANSLATION_LITERAL",
                                                                "value": {
                                                                    "code": "x_snc_pab_ee_tkit.uxf.f224e5a3530210102c30ddeeff7b128d.df785507cfc2075009d5b6734d851c50.rich_text_2.html",
                                                                    "comment": "",
                                                                    "message": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Source Sans Pro', Arial, sans-serif; margin: 32px 24px 24px 24px; border: 1px solid #d1d6d8; border-left: 4px solid #008e79; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #ffffff; color: #181a1b;\">\n<details style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\" open=\"\"><!-- Header / Summary -->\n<summary style=\"cursor: pointer; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0;\"><!-- Wrapper div with explicit long-hand padding to bypass the sanitizer --><!-- Sparkle Icon --> <br><span style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; color: #293e40; line-height: 1; padding: 10px; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Customer summary</span> <!-- Info Icon --><!-- Refresh icon --> <!-- Up/Down caret arrow --></summary>\n<!-- Collapsible Content -->\n<div style=\"padding: 28px 16px 16px 16px;\"><!-- Inner Content Box -->\n<div style=\"background-color: #f4f6f8; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; border: 1px solid #e1e5e7; color: #293e40; position: relative; padding: 16px;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 14px;\"><strong>IVR Call Summary:</strong> Duration: 04:12 | Sentiment: <span style=\"color: #c53030;\">Urgent</span>.<br><em>\"I need to report some suspicious activity on my account. There are transactions I didn't authorize, and I think I might have been scammed.\"</em><br><strong>Risk &amp; Verification:</strong> Verification <span style=\"color: #e67e22; font-weight: 600;\">Failed (OTP Required)</span>.<br><strong>AI Insight:</strong> Customer is reporting unauthorized transactions and potential fraud. Caller is verified and in good standing. Recommended action: Proceed with standard fraud intake and secure affected accounts.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 14px;\"><strong>Open Cases:</strong><br>&bull; <strong>Fraud Investigation (FRC0001044):</strong> Suspicious account activity involving unauthorized transactions is currently pending final approval.<br>&bull; <strong>Supplier Payments:</strong> Three new payment service cases are open for Rogers Centre Maintenance (PSC0001001), Event Staffing Agency (PSC0001002), and Catering Services Inc. (PSC0001003).<br>&bull; <strong>Business Loan (LNB0001001):</strong> Application for naming rights to the Summit Bar &amp; Lounge area at the Rogers Centre is awaiting info; currently in credit assessment pending an additional document.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0;\"><span style=\"color: #e67e22; font-style: italic;\"><strong>Account Trend:</strong> Higher than normal activity this month in comparison to the last three months.</span></p>\n<!-- Copy Icon --></div>\n<!-- Footer -->\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: 12px; font-size: 12px; color: #65777a;\">Generated by Now Assist. Check for accuracy.\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px;\"><!-- Thumbs Up --> <!-- Thumbs Down --></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</details>\n</div>\n<style>\n  /* Hides the default browser arrow for summary elements */\n  details > summary::-webkit-details-marker {\n    display: none;\n  }\n</style>"
                                                                }
                                                            }
                                                        },
