                                                                                "comment": "",
                                                                                "message": "<div style=\"font-family: 'Source Sans Pro', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; border: 1px solid #d1d4d7; border-left: 4px solid #338c4c; background-color: #ffffff; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; color: #343d42;\"><!-- Widget Header -->\n<div style=\"padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e6e8ea; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"color: #338c4c; margin-right: 6px;\">✨</span> IVR Call Summary</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #666; text-align: right;\"><strong>Duration:</strong> 02:14 | <strong>Sentiment:</strong> <span style=\"color: #d93025;\">Anxious</span></div>\n</div>\n<!-- Content Area -->\n<div style=\"padding: 12px;\"><!-- Transcription Snippet -->\n<div style=\"background-color: #f7f9fa; padding: 10px; border-radius: 4px; border-left: 3px solid #338c4c; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n<p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-style: italic; color: #444; margin: 0;\">\"I need to move 5,000 dollars to this external account right now, my daughter is in trouble and needs the money immediately.\"</p>\n</div>\n<!-- AI Analysis Grid -->\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #52575c; text-transform: uppercase;\">Verification</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #d93025; font-weight: bold;\">FAILED (Biometrics)</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #52575c; text-transform: uppercase;\">Fraud Score</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #d93025; font-weight: bold;\">89/100 (HIGH)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- AI Insight -->\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #52575c; margin-bottom: 4px;\">AI INSIGHT</div>\n<p style=\"font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4; color: #343d42; margin: 0;\">Caller is exhibiting signs of \"Urgency Scam\" social engineering. Account has been placed in a temporary hold pending human review.</p>\n</div>\n<a style=\"color: #338c4c; font-size: 12px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;\" href=\"#\">Show more</a></div>\n<!-- Footer -->\n<div style=\"padding: 6px 12px; text-align: right; border-top: 1px solid #e6e8ea;\"><span style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #aeb4b8; font-size: 14px;\">❐</span></div>\n</div>"
